  "question": {
    "text": "If the integral <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>10</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></msup></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#947;</mi></math> are integers and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> denotes the greatest integer less than or equal to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi></math> is equal to:",
    "image": null
